              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ohandiichile malaika weikanisa eyili eSaride, ori",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kano niko aka aboola, oyo ouli nAbaroho musaafu baNyasaye, nende tsinyininyini musaafu; mbu Emanyile ebikholebio, mbu ofumanga shinga olwa oli omulamu; nebutswa oli omufu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obe meeso, notinyisia ako akashisikaale, akabeele nikeenya okhufwa. Okhuba shinyoolile omulimokwo kwosi kwosi nikuusiibwe imbeli waNyasaye wanje ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho yitsulila akeenako aka waheebwa, naka wahulila, nokakhola, niwikalukhasia. Nebutswa noba noraba meeso ta, ndaleetsa shinga omwibi, kata shiolamanya isaa eya ndalakhwitsilakhwo tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olikhwo nameera amatuutu muSaride kabandu abarayoonoonia tsingubo tsiabwe ta; nabo balachenda ninasi mutsindafu, shichila bakwanile bario. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyo ouhula alafwalwa ario ebiifwalo ebilafu; kata shindalasiliisia eliiralie lirule mushitabu shiobulamu nahatuutu ta; ne ndaleeyama eliiralie imbeli waPapa, khandi imbeli wabamalaikabe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ouli namarwi, ahulile aka Roho asuniila tsikanisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
