            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ohandiichile malaika weikanisa eyili eFiladelefia, ori",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kano niko aka aboola, oyo ouli omutakatifu, ouli owatoto, ouli neshibohololo shiaDaudi; owikulanga, mana abulaho owikala; owikalanga, nabulaho owikula; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbu Emanyile ebikholebio; ne lola, ereele imbeliwo omuliango okwikuushe, okwa omundu yesi aranyala okhwikala ta. Emanyile shinga olwa olikhwo namaani amatuutu, khandi shinga olwa wahulila likhuwa lianje, noreeyambakhana eliira lianje ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lola, ekhuheelesia abokhusinagogi yaSetani, abo ababoola mbu nabaYahudi, ne nibarali bario ta, habula babeehanga; lola, ndalabaleera nimbeenamia hamakuluko, nimbamanyia shinga olwa ndakhuheelilenje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwa wahulila lilako lianje niwifwila, nasi siesi ndalakhulinda iwe oleshe okhwinjila mushise shiobuteemwi eshili okhwitsila eshialo shiosi, okhubateema abamenya khushialo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Endi ahambi okhwitsa; handakhwo khukeenako aka oli ninako, omundu yesi aleshe okhukhunuula olusimbilwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyo ouhula, ndalamukhola abe isiilo muhekalu yaNyasaye wanje, ne shialarulamwo khandi ta. Ndalahandiikha khuye eliira liaNyasaye wanje, nende eliira lielitookho liaNyasaye wanje, nilio Yerusalemu liyia, elirula mwikulu, okhurula ewaNyasaye wanje, khandi nende eliira lianje omwene liyia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ouli namarwi, ahulile aka Roho asunjila tsikanisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Akaboolelwa ikanisa yeLaodikia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
