          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ohandiichile malaika weikanisa eyili eLaodikia, ori",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kano niko aka aboola, oyo ouli Amina, omurumbusi wobuloli omusuubilwa, owatoto, omuchaachilo kwobulonji bwosi bwaNyasaye; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbu Emanyile ebikholebio, shinga olwa orali omunyifu tsi kata ouyiile pia ta. Ndakhachama niwakhaba kata omunyifu kata ouyiile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bulaano, olwa okholile butswa eshiyambala, norali kata ouyiile kata omunyifu ta, nekhufuutse orule mumunwa kwanje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwa oboolanga, mbu Endi omuyinda, akanje kakaasile; shindamba eshindu ta; ne noramanyile shinga olwa oli owamasila, owafuba, khandi omumanani, khandi omubofu, ouchendanga eshihechenye, ta; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kho ekhuchesiyia mbu okule khwisie itsahaabu eyalabibwa mumulilo, mbu oyindihale; nende ebiifwalo ebilafu, mbu wifwalekhwo, tsisoni tsieshihechenyeshio nitsiramanyikha ta; namalesi ketsimoni, okhwibakha tsimoni, mbu olole. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo bosi aba eheelanga embakondeshela nimbakuuma; kho rakhwo omwoyo, niwikalukhasia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lola, esinjiile khumuliango nikhong'onda; omundu yesi naba nahulila omwoyo kwanje, niyeekula omuliango, ndaleenjilamwo, nindia ninaye ebiliibwa, naye ninasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyo ouhula, ndalamufuchiilila okhwikhala ninasi khushifumbi shianje shioburuchi, shinga isie siesi olwa ndahula, ninzikhala nende Papa khushifumbishie shioburuchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OuIi namarwi, ahulile aka Roho asunjila tsikanisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
